              Total cost incurred by the employer. Includes basic pay, allowances, employer PF contribution (12%), gratuity provisions (15/26), and corporate health insurance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#181818] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] space-y-1.5 shadow-stacked-sm">
