            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-[15px] text-[#171717] dark:text-white">New Tax Regime (Section 115BAC)</h4>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#0070f3]/10 text-[#0070f3] font-semibold">Default</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-[13px] space-y-2 text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
              <li>• <strong>Standard Deduction:</strong> ₹75,000 flat deduction for all salaried individuals.</li>
              <li>• <strong>Section 87A Tax Rebate:</strong> Taxable income up to ₹7,00,000 pays <strong>₹0 tax</strong>. Therefore, a gross salary up to <strong>₹7.75 Lakhs is 100% tax-free</strong>.</li>
              <li>• <strong>Marginal Relief:</strong> Protects taxpayers earning slightly above ₹7 Lakhs from abrupt tax spikes.</li>
              <li>• <strong>Zero Paperwork:</strong> No need to collect rent receipts, investment proofs, or insurance certificates.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

